# How each host links the package's `zlib` library, as its Baton.toml
# `[native-libraries.zlib]` table resolves it (Decision 0148 sections 18
# and 19). Windows paths are relative to the package root, which holds
# zlib's import library and DLL under native/windows.
linux --link-library zlib=z
macos --link-library zlib=z
windows --link-library zlib=zlib
windows --link-search zlib=native/windows/lib
windows --runtime-file zlib=native/windows/bin/zlib1.dll
